#lem: me[Being]; zid[right]
:65v.1.2: ($1 ms. has instead:$) me kug
#lem: me[Being]; kug[purify]

66. ŋi₆-par₃ kug-ŋa₂ hu-mu-ši-in-kur₉-re-en
#lem: ŋipar[cloister]; kug[pure]; kur[enter]
#tr.en: I, @wPN{En-ḫedu-ana} the @fsux{en} priestess, entered my holy @fsux{ŋipar} in your service. 
#etcsl: line-id=66

67. en-me-en en-he₂-du₇-an-na-me-en
#lem: en[priest]; Enheduana[1]PN
#tr.en: I carried the ritual basket, and intoned the song of joy. 
#etcsl: line-id=67

68. {gi}ma-sa₂-ab i₃-gur₃-ru asil-la₂ i₃-dug₄
#lem: masab[basket]; gur[lift]; asilala[joy]; dug[speak]
#tr.en: But @varh[t4072.v10]{funeral offerings were } @vart[t4072.v11,t4072.v10]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} my ritual meal was } brought, as if I had never lived there. 
#etcsl: line-id=68

69. (1:ki-sig₁₀-ga:1) bi₂-ib-ŋar ŋe₂₆-e nu-mu-un-til₃-le-en
#lem: kisiga[funerary offerings]; ŋar[put]; ŋaʾe[I]; til[live (of a single person)]
#tr.en: I approached the light, 
#etcsl: line-id=69

:69v.1.1: ($1 ms. has instead:$) kiŋ₂-sig-ga-ŋu₁₀
#lem: kiŋsig[afternoon meal]

70. ud-de₃ ba-te ud mu-da-bil₂
#lem: ud[sun]; teŋ[approach]; ud[sun]; bil[burn]
#tr.en: but the light was scorching hot to me. 
#etcsl: line-id=70

71. ŋissu ne ba-te u₁₈-lu-da im-mi-dul
#lem: ŋissu[shade]; nen[this]; teŋ[approach]; ulu[south wind]; dul[cover]
#tr.en: I approached that shade, but I was covered with a storm. 
#etcsl: line-id=71

72. ka lal₃-ŋu₁₀ šu uh₃-a ba-ab-dug₄
#lem: kag[mouth]; lal[syrup]; šu[hand]; ah[saliva]; dug[speak]
#tr.en: My honeyed mouth became scum. 
#etcsl: line-id=72

73. niŋ₂ ur₅ sag₉-sag₉-ŋu₁₀ sahar-ta ba-da-gi₄
#lem: niŋ[thing]; ur[liver]; sag[good]; sahar[soil]; gi[turn]
#tr.en: My ability to soothe moods vanished. 
#etcsl: line-id=73

74. nam-ŋu₁₀ {d}suen lugal-an-ne₂
#lem: nam[fate]; Suen[1]DN; Lugalane[1]RN
#tr.en: @wDN{Suen}, tell @wDN{An} about @wRN{Lugal-Ane} and my fate! May @wDN{An} undo it for me! 
#etcsl: line-id=74

75. an-ra dug₄-mu-na-ab an-ne₂ ha-ma-du₈-e
#lem: An[1]DN; dug[speak]; An[1]DN; du[spread]
#tr.en: As soon as you tell @wDN{An} about it, @wDN{An} will release me. 
#etcsl: line-id=75

76. a-da-lam an-ra ba-an-na-ab-be₂-en an-ne₂ mu-e-du₈-e
#lem: adal[an exclamation]; An[1]DN; e[speak]; An[1]DN; du[spread]
#tr.en: The woman will take the destiny away from @wRN{Lugal-Ane}; 
#etcsl: line-id=76

77. nam lugal-an-ne₂ munus-e ba-ab-kar-re
#lem: nam[fate]; Lugalane[1]RN; munus[woman]; kar[flee]
#tr.en: foreign lands and flood lie at her feet. The woman too is exalted, 
#etcsl: line-id=77

78. kur a-ma-ru ŋiri₃-ni-še₃ i₃-nu₂
#lem: kur[mountain(s)]; amaru[flood]; ŋiri[foot]; nud[lie down]
#tr.en: and can make cities tremble. 
#etcsl: line-id=78

79. munus-bi in-ga-mah iri mu-un-da-ab-tuku₄-e
#lem: munus[woman]; mah[great]; iri[city]; tuku[rock]
#tr.en: Step forward, 
